ANCHOR 1: r2 maximizer over k<=N  =  product of primes = 1 (mod 4)
  N=    50: argmax_k r2 =     25 = {5: 2}  r2= 12  primes mod4={5: 1}
  N=   200: argmax_k r2 =     65 = {5: 1, 13: 1}  r2= 16  primes mod4={5: 1, 13: 1}
  N=  1000: argmax_k r2 =    325 = {5: 2, 13: 1}  r2= 24  primes mod4={5: 1, 13: 1}
  N=  5000: argmax_k r2 =   4225 = {5: 2, 13: 2}  r2= 36  primes mod4={5: 1, 13: 1}
  N= 20000: argmax_k r2 =   5525 = {5: 2, 13: 1, 17: 1}  r2= 48  primes mod4={5: 1, 13: 1, 17: 1}

