ANCHOR 2: grid lower bound  u(m x m grid) / n  grows (n^{c/loglog n})
  best squared-distance k*, unit-distance count U, U/n, and k* factorization
  m=  5 n=   25: k*=    5={5: 1}  U=     48  U/n=  1.92  r2(k*)=8
  m= 10 n=  100: k*=    5={5: 1}  U=    288  U/n=  2.88  r2(k*)=8
  m= 20 n=  400: k*=   65={5: 1, 13: 1}  U=   1744  U/n=  4.36  r2(k*)=16
  m= 40 n= 1600: k*=   65={5: 1, 13: 1}  U=   9744  U/n=  6.09  r2(k*)=16
  m= 70 n= 4900: k*=  325={5: 2, 13: 1}  U=  41120  U/n=  8.39  r2(k*)=24
  m=100 n=10000: k*= 1105={5: 1, 13: 1, 17: 1}  U=  98176  U/n=  9.82  r2(k*)=32

