ANCHOR 3: incidence structure -- unit-distance bipartite graph is K_{2,3}-free
  (two points share <=2 common unit-neighbors: two unit circles meet in <=2 pts)
  grid 15x15, dist=sqrt5: max common unit-neighbors over all pairs = 2  (<=2 confirms K_2,3-free)
  => Kovari-Sos-Turan gives O(n^3/2); Szemeredi-Trotter refines to O(n^4/3).
